null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_29","text":"\"If we're all just gonna kick the bucket someday, why break our backs trying to live life to the max?\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_30","text":"Like, what's the freaking point in thinking like that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_31","text":"Ugh, it's so frustrating!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_32","text":"Every now and then, crap like this happens and I feel like I'm suffocating.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_33","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_34","text":"I've made up my mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_35","text":"I refuse to accept this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_36","text":"Once I graduate, I'm going to become an exclusive designer for Rushae.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_37","text":"I'm not going to give up like all the others.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_38","text":"You only live once, so you might as well make the most of it, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_39","text":"Even students at M.M.R. Vocational School can have dreams!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_40","text":"So no matter whether I succeed or fail,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_41","text":"I have to at least try.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_ein_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_ein_02_42","text":"What are you going to do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"show